  "content": "<h1><em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bWMYAqyGe9g&list=PLp0jZgheSlXv_vjilwnbrOtdbmgvz1VkC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bWMYAqyGe9g?list=PLp0jZgheSlXv_vjilwnbrOtdbmgvz1VkC\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></a></em></h1>\n<h1>请阅读！</h1>\n<p><em>请在下载前仔细阅读以下内容并备份你的世界存档！</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[仅限 Fabric] 必须安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a>。请安装对应 Minecraft 版本的最新 Fabric API。</li>\n<li>[仅限 Fabric] <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mod Menu（模组菜单）</strong></a> 为可选安装，但它可以提供便捷的模组配置方式。</li>\n<li>请<strong>检查所有附加组件</strong>，确保它们与最新的 Minecraft Transit Railway 版本兼容！版本不匹配的附加组件将无法正常工作。</li>\n<li>欢迎加入 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mtrbbs.top%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MTRBBS</a> 论坛，发布问题、建议或 Bug 反馈！</li>\n<li>本模组<strong>不会</strong>再为任何旧版 Minecraft 提供更新。源代码已在 GitHub 上公开，您可以自行修改。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Minecraft Transit Railway 4.0.0</h2>\n<p><em>Minecraft Transit Railway（我的世界交通铁路）</em>是一款<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fMods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 模组</a>，允许您构建由自动化火车、船只、缆车和飞机组成的交通网络！</p>\n<p>4.0.0 版本是从头开始完全重写的新版本。车辆模拟代码已从 Minecraft 实例中分离出来，大大减少了 Minecraft 服务器上的卡顿现象。</p>\n<h2>4.0.0 版主要功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>自定义列车配置</li>\n<li>逼真的转向架和列车运动物理</li>\n<li>改进的信号系统</li>\n<li>侧向电梯</li>\n<li>移植自 Nemo's Transit Expansion 的 OBJ 模型特性</li>\n<li>车辆晃动效果</li>\n<li>全新的在线线路图及 OneBusAway 集成</li>\n<li>客户端 FPS 提升及服务端 TPS 提升</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLp0jZgheSlXuQCXu9UynrKuBnq2Ef_TSI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">详细了解这些功能。</a></p>\n<h2>推荐附加组件</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthe-tube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>MTR 伦敦地铁附加组件</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjcm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Joban Client Mod</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstation-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>车站装饰</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frussian-metro-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>俄罗斯地铁附加组件</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>帮助翻译本模组！</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrwd.in%252fminecraft-transit-railway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Transit Railway 模组的 Crowdin 翻译站点</a>现已开放！</p>\n<p>Crowdin 是一个基于云端的翻译平台，供翻译者贡献项目。在您的帮助下，我们可以将该模组翻译成多种不同的语言。您可以注册一个免费账户开始翻译工作。</p>\n<h2>有问题？评论？投诉？</h2>\n<p>让我们建立联系。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/PVZ2nfUaTW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252fjonathanho33\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/linked_in.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:jonho.minecraft@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/email.png\" alt=\"Email\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/minecraft_transit_railway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/PVZ2nfUaTW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/join-us-on-discord.png\" alt=\"Join us on Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/minecraft_transit_railway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/become-a-patron-on-patreon.png\" alt=\"Become a Patron on Patreon\"></a> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49fd23a75fd384b28d486c1471a72b7d4677c821.jpeg\" alt=\"Image 1\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2718\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e2f99c38fc8db3ae5fd89f534aae45129cf6987b.jpeg\" alt=\"Image 2\"></a></p>",
